OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHigh level
OL,6,Fcloud will lead to a bright but hazy
OL,7,Fevening, with dry conditions
OL,8,Fpersisting overnight. A few clear
OL,9,Fspells are expected, but another warm
OL,10,Fnight is likely with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,14,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light, but a
OL,15,Flittle brisker near some coasts.
OL,16,FFeeling very warm, locally hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
