OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,6,Fa little fresher and cloudier from
OL,7,FFriday with perhaps the odd shower by
OL,8,FSaturday. A spell of more organised
OL,9,Frain arriving late Sunday, as winds
OL,10,Fstrengthen.
